OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain clears
OL,6,Fthe far southeast during the evening,
OL,7,Fpartly cloudy and dry conditions
OL,8,Ffollow across the region. Remaining
OL,9,Fbreezy throughout with gusty winds
OL,10,Faround the coast. A cooler night for
OL,11,Fall.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA fresh start with fine and
OL,14,Fdry conditions. Cloud bubbling up with
OL,15,Fthe risk of a light shower through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Temperatures near average
OL,17,Fbut feeling cool in gusty winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
