OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FGenerally fine and dry on Sunday. Rain
OL,7,Fand low cloud on Monday and Tuesday
OL,8,Fmornings, heavy at times, with drier
OL,9,Fafternoons. Breezy, with temperatures
OL,10,Fbecoming above average.
